back?\", \"oh and, uh… can you add the Tresto picture to the… the Kanazawa Climbing Wall 2027 album?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0025\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please find the gyllix savings entry for me?\", \"Also, could you tell me whether anything is happening on sunday?\"], [\"I need to log in and check a balance but can't remember where I saved it, so can you dig up the gyllix savings for me?\", \"Totally separate thing, I'm trying to work out whether I can have a lazy weekend. Is anything going on sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0027\", \"v\": [[\"I feel like I haven't caught up with my friend in ages, so when am I next seeing Esther Fyrani?\", \"Ah, I'd rather not be up that early on a Saturday, so can you push the tabla one back by an hour?\", \"And while I'm thinking about it, I might want to organise a lift, so who's coming to that?\", \"Oh, I want to get a card sorted well ahead of time for once, so when is Esther's birthday?\", \"Switching gears, I'm trying to pick the renovation stuff back up, so can you pull up my archway plan notes?\", \"Great, and I had some ideas scribbled down for the other project too, so what about thimble?\"], [\"umm when am I next, uh, seeing Esther Fyrani?\", \"ok can you move the tabla one… make it an hour later?\", \"and who's, um, who's coming to that?\", \"oh wait, when's Esther's birthday again?\", \"ok different thing, uh, can you get my archway plan notes up?\", \"hmm and what about thimble?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0028\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how much I've spent in the bagpipes syndicate so far?\", \"On another note, would you show me what I wrote yesterday in my diary, please?\", \"Actually, never mind, please leave it.\", \"Also, could you show me any pictures I have from last week?\"], [\"how much have i spent in bagpipes syndicate\", \"diff thing, what did i put in my diary yesterday\", \"nah leave it thx\", \"oh and what pics have i got from last week\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0029\", \"v\": [[\"what have i spent on in bagpipes syndicate\", \"what did the trusum come to\", \"diff thing, whats left to do on the quote plan\"], [\"Could you show me the expenses I've had in the bagpipes syndicate, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you tell me what the trusum came to?\", \"On a different subject, could you tell me what's still left to do on the quote plan?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0030\", \"v\": [[\"I'm pulling together all the paperwork for the orchard before I meet anyone about it, so could you show me which documents are linked to Kanazawa Orchard?\"], [\"what docs have i got linked to Kanazawa Orchard\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0032\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to settle up after the trip and want the full picture first, so what do the Bruges expenses add up to altogether?\", \"Separate thing, I need to get back in touch with my mechanic, so can you pull up everything that mentions Flendie?\", \"Right, I keep forgetting about this, so could you set me a to-do to call Flendie next friday so it actually happens?\"], [\"what do the Bruges expenses come to\", \"diff thing, show me evrything mentioning Flendie\", \"can u make a task to call Flendie next friday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0033\", \"v\": [[\"delete Tresto photo\"], [\"umm can you… can you get rid of the Tresto photo?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0034\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the shelf photo?\", \"Also, would you mind clearing out the Trynnis notes, please?\", \"Oh dear, I didn't mean to do that. Could you undo it, please?\"], [\"pls delete the shelf photo\", \"also clear out the Trynnis notes\", \"oops undo that pls\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0035\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the piccolo note?\", \"On another matter, would you find the bugle close-up for me, please?\", \"Thank you. Could you add a task to sign the bugle photo tomorrow?\"], [\"delete piccolo note\", \"find bugle close-up\", \"task: sign the bugle photo tomorrow\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0036\", \"v\": [[\"where's my paperweight scan\", \"what else is in that folder\", \"vet appointment next monday at quarter past eleven\"], [\"Could you tell me where my paperweight scan is, please?\", \"Thank you. Would you mind showing me what else is in that folder alongside it?\", \"Also, could you please put a vet appointment in my calendar for next monday at quarter past eleven?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0037\", \"v\": [[\"I've let the project slide a bit over the holidays and want to get going again, so what's still left to do on the climbing wall plan?\"], [\"Could you tell me what's still left to do on the climbing wall plan, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0038\", \"v\": [[\"how much does Chinonso Chukwu owe me in bagpipes syndicate\", \"and Konmia?\"], [\"I want to square things up before the next meet so nobody's out of pocket, so how much does Chinonso Chukwu owe me in the bagpipes syndicate?\", \"Right, and while we're settling up, what about Konmia?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0039\", \"v\": [[\"umm what was the… what's the last thing I wrote in my journal?\"], [\"I've been meaning to get back into the habit of journaling but I've lost track of where I left off, so what was the last thing I wrote in there?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w01-0040\", \"v\": [[\"book table at Ely Pool, the weekend\"], [\"uh can you reserve a table at Ely Pool for, um, for the weekend?\"]]}","ttft_ms":10449,"type":"result","duration_ms":29407,"uuid":"b32a4de3-b9b7-4f79-bc92-25189f6efaf7","ttft_stream_ms":1369,"time_to_request_ms":129,"first_content_frame_ms":1370,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21806880,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278356864.486,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
